eo archeologico regionale antonino salinas","ancient greek",[],{"title":290,"body":291,"divs":292,"editions":313,"images":323,"handnote":324},"ISic030010. Lead defixio","\u003Cdiv id=\"editions\">\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Savannah Neibart\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Χάμις\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"idionym\" data-text=\"Χάμις\">Χάμις\u003C/span>\u003C/span> ἐπέχ̣ο̄ \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>κα&lt;ὶ&gt; νόσο̄ ῥοπᾶι \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ἐπ’ ἀτελείαι ℎο-\u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>τ̣[ι] ΚΑ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">..\u003C/span>]Ε̣[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">..\u003C/span>]Ο̣ΝΤΙ \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Savannah Neibart\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Χάμις\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"idionym\" data-text=\"Χάμις\">ΧΑΜΙΣ\u003C/span>\u003C/span>ΕΠΕ.Ο̄\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>ΚΑΝΟΣΟ̄ΡΟΠΑΙ\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ΕΠΑΤΕΛΕΙΑΙℎΟ\u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>.[.]ΚΑ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">··\u003C/span>].[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">··\u003C/span>].ΝΤΙ\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>  \u003Cspan>Text after Bettarini\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2> translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>Je te maintiens dans la crise fatale de la maladie afin que tu ne puisses atteindre tes objectifs.(Dubois)\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2>Italian translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7122-2511\">Valentina Mignosa\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Chamis ti conduco alla fase critica della malattia perché tu non possa portare a termine ...\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>Il doit s'agir d'une imprécation contre un grabataire dont l'impotence réjouit le rédacteur de la tablette. (Dubois)\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>A pesar de su brevedad, èste es uno de los documentos que demuestra un estilo màas refinado, con una figura insòlita como es la metáfora, y un verbo también inusual, ἐπέχω, que hacen de ella una de las defixiones de mayor originalidad. (Lopez-Jimeno)\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Questa lamina ci offre l'occasione di rivedere l'abusato cliché che vuole le defixiones redatte unicamente secondo formule stereotipe. Il problema interpretativo riguarda le prime due linee, dove a una sequenza iniziale certamente di tipo onomastico segue il verbo επεχω - un unicum nelle maledizioni - e la singolare espressione νόσου ῥοπα. Pare evidente quindi che la volontà di chi ha inciso la lamina è di condurre (επεχω) il defisso alla \"fase critica della malattia\", evidentemente per procurarne la morte. (Bettarini)\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Brugnone 1976 81-83, no. 4 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002280\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002280\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> 1976-1977 26.0111 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Jordan 1985 175, no. 97 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001391\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001391\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Arena 1989 no. 66 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000638\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000638\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Dubois 1989 \u003Ca href=\"http://www.persee.fr/doc/efr_0000-0000_1989_cat_119_1\" target=\"_blank\">32\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> López-Jimeno 1991 no. 7 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001858\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001858\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Curbera 1999 178, no. 20 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002060\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002060\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Bettarini 2005 17 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001388\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001388\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\">  Line 1-4  3.5   \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. \u003C/div>",[293,296,299,302,304,307,310],{"id":294,"html":295},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Savannah Neibart\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Χάμις\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"idionym\" data-text=\"Χάμις\">Χάμις\u003C/span>\u003C/span> ἐπέχ̣ο̄ \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>κα&lt;ὶ&gt; νόσο̄ ῥοπᾶι \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ἐπ’ ἀτελείαι ℎο-\u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>τ̣[ι] ΚΑ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">..\u003C/span>]Ε̣[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">..\u003C/span>]Ο̣ΝΤΙ \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Savannah Neibart\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Χάμις\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"idionym\" data-text=\"Χάμις\">ΧΑΜΙΣ\u003C/span>\u003C/span>ΕΠΕ.Ο̄\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>ΚΑΝΟΣΟ̄ΡΟΠΑΙ\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ΕΠΑΤΕΛΕΙΑΙℎΟ\u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>.[.]ΚΑ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">··\u003C/span>].[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">··\u003C/span>].ΝΤΙ\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>",{"id":297,"html":298},"apparatus","\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>  \u003Cspan>Text after Bettarini\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>",{"id":300,"html":301},"translation","\u003Ch2> translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>Je te maintiens dans la crise fatale de la maladie afin que tu ne puisses atteindre tes objectifs.(Dubois)\u003C/p>  ",{"id":300,"html":303},"\u003Ch2>Italian translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7122-2511\">Valentina Mignosa\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Chamis ti conduco alla fase critica della malattia perché tu non possa portare a termine ...\u003C/p>  ",{"id":305,"html":306},"commentary","\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>Il doit s'agir d'une imprécation contre un grabataire dont l'impotence réjouit le rédacteur de la tablette. (Dubois)\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>A pesar de su brevedad, èste es uno de los documentos que demuestra un estilo màas refinado, con una figura insòlita como es la metáfora, y un verbo también inusual, ἐπέχω, que hacen de ella una de las defixiones de mayor originalidad. (Lopez-Jimeno)\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Questa lamina ci offre l'occasione di rivedere l'abusato cliché che vuole le defixiones redatte unicamente secondo formule stereotipe. Il problema interpretativo riguarda le prime due linee, dove a una sequenza iniziale certamente di tipo onomastico segue il verbo επεχω - un unicum nelle maledizioni - e la singolare espressione νόσου ῥοπα. Pare evidente quindi che la volontà di chi ha inciso la lamina è di condurre (επεχω) il defisso alla \"fase critica della malattia\", evidentemente per procurarne la morte. (Bettarini)\u003C/p>  ",{"id":308,"html":309},"bibliography","\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Brugnone 1976 81-83, no. 4 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002280\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002280\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> 1976-1977 26.0111 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Jordan 1985 175, no. 97 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001391\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001391\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Arena 1989 no. 66 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000638\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000638\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Dubois 1989 \u003Ca href=\"http://www.persee.fr/doc/efr_0000-0000_1989_cat_119_1\" target=\"_blank\">32\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> López-Jimeno 1991 no. 7 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001858\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001858\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Curbera 1999 178, no. 20 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002060\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002060\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Bettarini 2005 17 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001388\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001388\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  ",{"id":311,"html":312},"license"," Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. ",[314,316,319,320],{"html":315},"Text encoding: Savannah Neibart",{"id":317,"lang":125,"html":318},"edition-interpretive","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Χάμις\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"idionym\" data-text=\"Χάμις\">Χάμις\u003C/span>\u003C/span> ἐπέχ̣ο̄ \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>κα&lt;ὶ&gt; νόσο̄ ῥοπᾶι \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ἐπ’ ἀτελείαι ℎο-\u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>τ̣[ι] ΚΑ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">..\u003C/span>]Ε̣[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">..\u003C/span>]Ο̣ΝΤΙ \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>",{"html":315},{"id":321,"lang":125,"html":322},"edition-diplomatic","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Χάμις\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"idionym\" data-text=\"Χάμις\">ΧΑΜΙΣ\u003C/span>\u003C/span>ΕΠΕ.Ο̄\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>ΚΑΝΟΣΟ̄ΡΟΠΑΙ\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ΕΠΑΤΕΛΕΙΑΙℎΟ\u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>.[.]ΚΑ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">··\u003C/span>].[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">··\u003C/span>].ΝΤΙ\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>",[],[],"\u003C?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>\n\u003C?xml-model href=\"https://epidoc.stoa.org/schema/latest/tei-epidoc.rng\" type=\"application/xml\" schematypens=\"http://relaxng.org/ns/structure/1.0\"?>\n\u003C?xml-model href=\"../schematron/ircyr-checking.sch\" schematypens=\"http://purl.oclc.org/dsdl/schematron\"?>\n\u003CTEI xmlns=\"http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0\" xmlns:xi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude\" xml:lang=\"en\">\n    \u003CteiHeader>\n        \u003CfileDesc>\n            \u003CtitleStmt>\n                \u003Ctitle>Lead defixio\u003C/title>\n                \u003Ceditor ref=\"#JP\">Jonathan Prag\u003C/editor>\n                \u003Cprincipal ref=\"#SN\">Savannah Neibart\u003C/principal>\n                \u003Cfunder>John Fell OUP Research Fund\u003C/funder>\n                \u003Cfunder>\u003Cref target=\"https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/885040\">ERC Advanced Grant no.885040\u003C/ref>\u003C/funder>\n                \u003CrespStmt>\n                    \u003Cname xml:id=\"JP\" ref=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag\u003C/name>\n                    \u003Cresp>project direction, template development and general editor\u003C/resp>\n                \u003C/respStmt>\n                \u003CrespStmt>\n                    \u003Cname xml:id=\"SN\" ref=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2868-9164\">Savannah Neibart\u003C/name> \n                    \u003Cresp>data collation and editing, encoding text in Epidoc\u003C/resp>\n                \u003C/respStmt>\n                \u003CrespStmt>\n                    \u003Cname xml:id=\"SS\" ref=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3914-9569\">Simona Stoyanova\u003C/name>\n                    \u003Cresp>standardisation of template and tidying up encoding\u003C/resp>\n                \u003C/respStmt>\n                \u003CrespStmt>\n                    \u003Cname xml:id=\"VM\" ref=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7122-2511\">Valentina Mignosa\u003C/name>\n                    \u003Cresp>creating the file and adding basic metadata\u003C/resp>\n                \u003C/respStmt>\n                \u003CrespStmt>\n                    \u003Cname xml:id=\"TS\" ref=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6965-8105\">Thea Sommerschield\u003C/name>\n                    \u003Cresp>Original data collection in ISicDef\u003C/resp>\n                \u003C/respStmt>\n            \u003C/titleStmt>\n            \u003CpublicationStmt>\n                \u003Cauthority>I.Sicily\u003C/authority>\n                \u003Cidno type=\"filename\">ISic030010\u003C/idno>\n                \u003Cidno type=\"TM\">696119\u003C/idno>\n                \u003Cidno type=\"EDR\">158929\u003C/idno>\n                \u003Cidno type=\"EDH\"/>\n                \u003Cidno type=\"EDCS\">64800282\u003C/idno>\n                \u003Cidno type=\"PHI\">301172\u003C/idno>\n                \u003Cidno type=\"PHI\">340332\u003C/idno>\n                \u